# Multi-tenant & security

- Every business row has `clinic_id`. Users see only their clinic (RLS). No cross-clinic membership in v1 (D7).
- Never put Supabase **service role** keys in client code. Service role = server only; super-admin impersonation must be audited (D41).
- Never bypass RLS “for convenience”. Fix policies / use correct client instead.
- Roles: respect RBAC from PRD (owner / doctor / reception / etc.). Owner MFA required; others not (D11).
- Storage paths: `clinic_id / patient_id / ...`; private buckets + signed URLs (D21).
- Analytics/logs: **no patient names**; use `clinic_id`, role, event names (D33).
- GDPR hard delete only with owner approval flow (D35).
- Peer amounts visibility is a clinic setting — do not assume doctors see all money (D17).
- Plan limits are hard blocks + upsell (D8), not soft warnings only.
